# Migrations

- Expand/contract only. Never deploy a migration that requires old and new code to cut over in the same release unless explicitly approved.
- Prefer additive columns with backfill plans; document dual-write windows.
- Destructive changes require a follow-up PR after readers are gone.
- Include a rollback note (what is safe vs irreversible).
